{
  "name": "default",
  "_comment": [
    "THE boot-default standing scene for the 1920px closed ring.",
    "Bed: old lava-lamp purple ambient — layered dark purple/blue/violet",
    "blobs drifting slowly (like the fcob firmware's onboard generative",
    "nebula), wrap-seamless (gradient scale = ring length; blob particles",
    "use physics wrap so they cross the seam).",
    "Orb: ~20 LEDs long, soft gaussian edges (sigma 5 -> visible ~+-10px),",
    "blend 'boost' = relative brightening of whatever bed is underneath",
    "(a glowing lens that takes on the local hue). opacity 1.4 -> x2.4 in",
    "linear light -> ~+50% brighter AS DISPLAYED (after gamma 2.2).",
    "Motion: physics.drive — top speed 128 px/s (one lap / 15s), speed",
    "wanders organically down to 42.7 px/s (one lap / 45s) and back, and",
    "direction reverses smoothly ~1.5 times per minute (decelerate, flip,",
    "accelerate — never teleports)."
  ],
  "master": {"brightness": 0.9, "tone_map": "reinhard"},
  "layers": [
    {
      "type": "gradient",
      "blend": "add",
      "palette": ["#170529", "#1d0837", "#130524", "#1b0731", "#150a3a"],
      "scale": 1920,
      "scroll_speed": 3,
      "brightness": 0.6
    },
    {
      "type": "particles",
      "blend": "add",
      "opacity": 0.9,
      "physics": {
        "wrap": true,
        "bounce": {"enabled": false},
        "damping": 0.25,
        "turbulence": {"accel": 4.0, "scale": 640.0, "speed": 0.05}
      },
      "particles": [
        {"pos": 0,    "vel": 4,  "color": "#2a0a52", "size": 70, "lifetime": null},
        {"pos": 260,  "vel": -3, "color": "#151b6e", "size": 55, "lifetime": null},
        {"pos": 520,  "vel": 5,  "color": "#3a1270", "size": 80, "lifetime": null},
        {"pos": 780,  "vel": -4, "color": "#1b1060", "size": 48, "lifetime": null},
        {"pos": 1040, "vel": 3,  "color": "#41156e", "size": 75, "lifetime": null},
        {"pos": 1300, "vel": -5, "color": "#2c0e5e", "size": 60, "lifetime": null},
        {"pos": 1560, "vel": 4,  "color": "#101050", "size": 65, "lifetime": null},
        {"pos": 1780, "vel": -3, "color": "#30105c", "size": 52, "lifetime": null}
      ],
      "render": {"falloff": "gaussian", "fade_out": false}
    },
    {
      "type": "particles",
      "blend": "boost",
      "opacity": 1.4,
      "physics": {
        "wrap": true,
        "bounce": {"enabled": false},
        "drive": {"top_speed": 128, "min_speed": 42.7,
                  "reverses_per_min": 1.5, "smooth_s": 2.5,
                  "mod_period_s": 37, "mod_period2_s": 23}
      },
      "particles": [
        {"pos": 0, "vel": 128, "color": "#ffffff", "size": 5.0,
         "lifetime": null}
      ],
      "render": {"falloff": "gaussian", "fade_out": false}
    }
  ]
}
